description:
Parse a User-Agent header into browser, engine, OS, device type, vendor, model and CPU (ua-parser-js), and detect search, AI, social, SEO and monitoring bots and HTTP libraries. Notes explain User-Agent reduction limits such as Windows 11 reporting as Windows NT 10.0.

Returns: JSON { summary, browser{name,version,major}, engine{name,version}, os{name,version}, device{type,vendor,model}, cpu{architecture}, isBot, bot{name,category,owner}|null, notes[] }.
Example input: {"userAgent":"Mozilla/5.0 (iPhone; CPU iPhone OS 17_5 like Mac OS X) AppleWebKit/605.1.15 (KHTML, like Gecko) Version/17.5 Mobile/15E148 Safari/604.1"}
